cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "exosome-risk-score-glioma: analysis code for an exosome-related gene score in glioma"
abstract: "Analysis code for a 15-gene exosome-related prognostic risk score in glioma (TCGA-GBM/LGG, external validation in CGGA-325 and CGGA-693), with SHAP interpretation, pathway and immune deconvolution analyses, tumour mutational burden, drug-sensitivity prediction, single-cell mapping and Mendelian randomization with colocalization."
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/BioStatsByGan/exosome-risk-score-glioma"
keywords:
  - glioma
  - exosome
  - prognostic model
  - SHAP
  - TCGA
  - CGGA
  - Mendelian randomization
